              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambani nizilungisele, nazi, nibone indawo yakhe lapho ehlala khona nokuthi ngubani owambona khona; ngoba ngitsheliwe ukuthi wenza ubuqili obukhulu.",
          "type": "text",
