          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baqeda, bahamba phambi kukaSawule baya eZifi, kepha uDavide nabantu bakhe basehlane laseMahoni ethafeni eliseningizimu kwaseJesmoni.",
          "type": "text",
