          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesuka waya ngaphetsheya kwentaba, loDavida labantu bakhe bengapha kwentaba; ngoba uSawule nabantu bakhe bamhaqa uDavide namadoda akhe ukuba bababambe.",
          "type": "text",
