          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSawule wabuya ekumsukeleni uDavide, waya ukuhlangabezana namaFilisti; ngalokho babiza leyo ndawo ngokuthi iSelama-Hlekoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.28",
